# ---- per-seed trainer artifacts under results/ ----
# A seed dir tracks only its small result files (adapter_config.json, summary.json,
# metrics.ndjson, posttrain_eval.json, sampled_eval*.json). Everything else the HF/TRL
# trainer drops beside them is a reproducible artifact, not a result: the LoRA weights,
# a full copy of the tokenizer, the pickled training args, the generated model card.
# *.safetensors / *.parquet / *.jsonl are already ignored further up, which is also why
# each seed's committed metrics file is named .ndjson rather than .jsonl.
results/**/tokenizer.json
results/**/tokenizer_config.json
results/**/training_args.bin
results/**/chat_template.jinja
results/**/seed*/README.md
results/**/completions/
